35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Last year we barely met. The shared house year had no private space. I need a town.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The separate rooms cost 8,000 yen more for some. The island house is one bill.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The inn baths are open late, but the island house has one cold bathroom.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry takes two days. The train is only ninety minutes. The city is flexible.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The all-in rate is unfair to light eaters. The valley inn is 17,000 yen all-in.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, the train time is much better for preserving our days.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the valley inn includes meals, which simplifies the bill.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,The island bathroom sounds stressful. I prefer the inn baths.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,The city trains run every few minutes. No waiting.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"The city bed is 12,000 to 20,000 yen, plus meals. That is unpredictable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The city allows separate routes. That might explain the loneliness.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The island house divides the bill evenly. That is fair.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"The inn mealtimes are fixed. Dinner at six, breakfast at half seven.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The spa valley bus stops before seven. That limits evening movement.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,The valley inn rate is fixed. I like knowing the total.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am leaning towards the spa town for balance.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"The island seems fair for money, but the bathroom worries me.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am worried about the island bathroom. The inn seems safer.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"The city is best for travel time, but the cost is high.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,The valley inn offers a clear total cost. I prefer that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
